  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The VRChat Cache clearing system in it's current state could use an update. Currently, it only stores up to 20GB on PC and has to manually cleared in it's entirety every time when desired. Something I think could be added to is the ability to change the limit on cached content so users can have more extra space on their device when needed. Another addition I think could have some use would include the option to automatically clear the cache on startup, but keep the following things to avoid annoyance:\nCurrent home world\nFavorite/created avatars\nFriends' avatars (regardless of who created it)\nRecently visited worlds\nAdding these features should be pretty useful for those who are very limited on space on their PC. As for Quest, I don't think it should be needed as it's cache is limited to only 5GB.",
